[{"title":"和缉熙示弟之作示诸生","author":"罗伦","text":"寒饿添疏懒，轻肥误俊英。\n人心争水火，造物剧孩婴。\n自在閒中睡，仓皇纸上名。\n分明眼前事，聊复醉还醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10776,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘氏孟祯迎晖楼","author":"罗伦","text":"天道此中和，江楼曙气多。\n浮云消海岱，病眼对山河。\n年老流光易，春酣放口歌。\n茅檐寒饿久，爱尔数相过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10777,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读书楼为门生张麟赋","author":"罗伦","text":"溪山深隐处，一径渐通幽。\n六合同吾宇，南州独此楼。\n浮云连海动，河汉自天流。\n高枕丹霞上，春风笑未休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10778,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽揭竹庵","author":"罗伦","text":"竹庵忘此老，伏腊走比邻。\n碧草他生梦，黄花化后身。\n石田孤鹤瘦，烟水五湖贫。\n却忆经行处，西风泪满巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10779,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南村别墅为饶松坡题","author":"罗伦","text":"吾爱南村好，频过处士家。\n白云留客住，浊酒隔墙赊。\n阴壑藏春雪，清溪洗暮霞。\n自今来往惯，薇蕨早生芽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10780,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答陈公甫","author":"罗伦","text":"青天回白首，霞外送冥鸿。\n沙界无穷树，霜空见此松。\n君王留一剑，老病息孤蓬。\n试问云台趣，农谈信野翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10781,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"公甫感秋有吟因寄章德懋庄孔昜及伦三人用次其韵","author":"罗伦","text":"大地秋风动，万窍无定音。\n山河孤鹤梦，风雨一龙吟。\n青眼有此客，白云何处心。\n思君令人老，华发一千寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10782,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佛岭三首 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"宋运方当绝，人心未死何。\n降王纳款日，义士挥天戈。\n巩信支东固，文山节五坡。\n君看草木气，犹自壮山河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10783,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佛岭三首 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"秦贾先亡国，文山可奈何。\n自怜天下诏，谁奋鲁阳戈。\n生死勤三后，忠诚动五坡。\n高风不可见，名落旧山河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10784,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佛岭三首 其三","author":"罗伦","text":"追尘特地起，孤愤奈天何。\n翠玉楼前泪，黄云塞下戈。\n二龙争北野，孤鹤梦东坡。\n却忆樊笼外，乘槎欲泛河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10785,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"?头次陈秉常","author":"罗伦","text":"万里昆崙小，苍茫快此登。\n层云开赤脚，阴壑动玄灵。\n练石嫌天漏，寻花爱国馨。\n青山来恋我，应识草堂情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10786,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"两晖楼次容彦昭楼旧名迎晖梦改两晖","author":"罗伦","text":"画栋飞云表，鸿名落梦间。\n大明开昼夜，光霁动天山。\n高枕元龙卧，横江一鹤还。\n老夫幽兴熟，为尔一开颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10787,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"光霁岩次容彦昭","author":"罗伦","text":"太极开天府，清虚此一堂。\n几回桑海变，不及广寒香。\n万象悬金谷，群仙醉玉床。\n蓬壶深咫尺，生被碧山囊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10788,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"府教岩次容彦昭","author":"罗伦","text":"金身不可断，铁心应易酸。\n风吹浮云去，吾与南山安。\n额额苍天在，潇潇白日寒。\n横流当砥柱，回却黄河乾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10789,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扇和岩次容彦昭 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"如何深厚底，藏得一壶春。\n朔雪不到地，春风长被人。\n天陶吾辈老，花好自家新。\n闻道山灵语，知予乐是真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10790,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扇和岩次容彦昭 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"阳和在深谷，无秋旦旦春。\n山魑憎过客，岩燕喜来人。\n风㰱琼芝脆，天清玉宇新。\n桃花逐流水，去住任天真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10791,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水心书院次容彦昭","author":"罗伦","text":"游子来何之，来之水心亭。\n同流混清浊，高思入玄青。\n病菊东篱醉，幽兰陋室馨。\n石齐频入梦，经纬两冥冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10792,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书崇仁万玉山僧房廖钦止处登瀛洲达此寺三十里","author":"罗伦","text":"王道荒东汉，山名自太康。\n玑衡斟北斗，雷雨动西方。\n客梦云随鹤，禅心月在床。\n登瀛三十里，前路满风光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10793,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和林缉熙游玉笥山并序","author":"罗伦","text":"野仙临玉笥，引袖拂天星。\n侍立双童小，看山只眼明。\n洞云含雨润，鹤梦带烟醒。\n自叹罗浮客，春杯溢四溟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10794,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送饶经历还金溪","author":"罗伦","text":"问病来金嶂，高谈彻玉关。\n何人无白发，吾道有青山。\n云水流行处，渔樵问答间。\n孤舟今夜别，明月共君还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10795,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泷滨次容彦昭二首 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"南海三君子，来问泷冈居。\n山高日月小，树古虬龙纡。\n暮年得一饱，衰力尚三馀。\n寄言白沙老，倦翼且栖梧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10796,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泷滨次容彦昭二首 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"别业来何处，泷冈水竹居。\n江山容我老，朱紫信谁纡。\n南海三君过，西窗两月馀。\n剧谈中夜起，香露滴高梧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10797,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"毛氏西园次容彦昭","author":"罗伦","text":"毛氏西园好，溪南未有之。\n参横虎出夜，松暝鹤归迟。\n病骨青藜杖，秋香短竹篱。\n小窗孤榻在，合眼见巢夷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10798,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梅鼎归铅山","author":"罗伦","text":"归路铅山县，梅花万树春。\n青天元属我，白发肯饶人。\n道德看前辈，冰渊战此身。\n寄书长不达，传与故乡亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10799,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"定赖丕初宿金牛梦意","author":"罗伦","text":"气运回千载，何人朕兆先。\n天花摇凤舞，云锦摆龙眠。\n垂统开来学，沿源得不传。\n东风又周道，四海正悬悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10800,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王生归家","author":"罗伦","text":"王家兄弟好，吾道在南安。\n礼乐开三极，阴阳浑一丸。\n春深冰自水，人去雪犹寒。\n天末凉风起，浮云正好看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10801,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清风洞次容彦昭","author":"罗伦","text":"问尔来何际，来从象帝先。\n后灵噫紫府，和气荡光天。\n骨冷龙眠处，魂清鹤梦边。\n古今浑不息，君子自乾乾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10802,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"翠华岩次容彦昭","author":"罗伦","text":"皇天开洞府，自我马蹄忙。\n春漏黄金界，云和翠玉房。\n宝山阴火动，玄窦紫霞香。\n回首无何上，神功接混茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10803,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和林缉熙过刘宅韵","author":"罗伦","text":"举举扶胥子，云楼日几层。\n野人回碧眼，赤子问青灯。\n山尽天无碍，春归梦有凭。\n冥鸿看杳杳，遮莫顾虞罾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10804,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘师览分教沅陵","author":"罗伦","text":"塞外传金口，沙头醉玉卮。\n青山宜我病，明月忆君思。\n江汉清秋润，沅湘白日飞。\n庙堂登稷契，云壑隐巢夷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10805,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江山一览亭","author":"罗伦","text":"一目空南极，飞梯上紫烟。\n几鬟孤照外，匹练落霞边。\n江汉心宗海，嵩华气拥天。\n鲁城春眼后，此地亦悠然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10806,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一横亭","author":"罗伦","text":"有客在南溟，文章气已冥。\n何人看北斗，稚子指东星。\n下钓纶方定，烧茶梦未醒。\n湘云今我是，曾上妙高亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10807,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文乡书舍","author":"罗伦","text":"吾道贞元日，文乡气又春。\n乾坤三万里，江汉一完人。\n山气通云谷，泉声是泗滨。\n大虚皆我屋，明月可芳邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10808,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苍雪亭","author":"罗伦","text":"苍颜未觉老，古心谁与同。\n风雪不改色，山林惟此翁。\n吾怜造化意，乃在山谷中。\n盘桓成浩叹，万壑生清风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10809,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月梦","author":"罗伦","text":"南师翻孔孟，西客镂唐虞。\n秋月梧桐梦，春风故旧书。\n阳回天有信，云动海成虚。\n试问圭峰老，乾坤几乘除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10810,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天上人间","author":"罗伦","text":"吾庐依北斗，人道是东山。\n云卧星槎稳，天中帝柱閒。\n路由黄道表，人在紫薇间。\n谁捧三竿日，凌烟梦未还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10811,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小蓬莱","author":"罗伦","text":"引袖拂蓬莱，飞云九曲台。\n火当三殿去，山送七星来。\n洞府春如海，秋空夜不埃。\n白衣如邂逅，沈醉菊花杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10812,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九曲飞云","author":"罗伦","text":"罗浮在天上，指点是玄微。\n九曲云中去，三天日下飞。\n紫薇回閤道，清露湿仙衣。\n世路羊肠险，人间闷不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10813,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"言志","author":"罗伦","text":"归路玉花骢，行人大华东。\n龙头惊昨梦，马足信东风。\n天上开三省，江南问一峰。\n养雏成大鹤，种子得高松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10814,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十九日梦","author":"罗伦","text":"秋风为谁急，秋草为谁深。\n吾道通天地，人心自古今。\n误疑梅是雪，不道菊成金。\n昨日东篱下，山樽满满斟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10815,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦吟浮香坞","author":"罗伦","text":"异香浮上界，春到紫薇家。\n人道谁从定，天心未有涯。\n野风依客兴，丹露对流霞。\n可是长春境，蓬莱万岁花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10816,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦吟异奏亭","author":"罗伦","text":"君行孚天地，君心动鬼神。\n大名中日月，吴乐播韶钧。\n阿閤犹仪凤，西郊未出麟。\n如何湖上曲，长奏洞庭春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10817,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦定春堂吟","author":"罗伦","text":"东风无著手，却向草堂来。\n大化留钧座，光天落寿杯。\n有云皆载两，无地不栽梅。\n馀庆吾家厚，元君未凿抔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10818,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦同春馆吟","author":"罗伦","text":"日日是春风，吾家大化同。\n一诚孚犬马，五教及儿童。\n水暖鱼鱼出，泥融燕燕通。\n度江春色满，花柳各青红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10819,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二日梦文冈阡吟","author":"罗伦","text":"虚无曾指点，三老已蓬莱。\n春意回函丈，天光落上台。\n大明万怪伏，文秀一峰来。\n无限风光好，南山进寿杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10820,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入道门","author":"罗伦","text":"尔等由吾道，须先自洗心。\n雪消春动草，月上夜鸣琴。\n杏脚书坛古，云根石室深。\n几人能到此，白发忽千寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10821,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古潭为刘礼作赋","author":"罗伦","text":"秋江有古潭，开自无极先。\n飞流挂北斗，灵源通上天。\n阳潜含浑浑，阴闭入玄玄。\n深浅沧桑外，浮沈宇宙边。\n洞明空地底，虚大贮天圆。\n日月含黄道，星辰泳紫躔。\n脉通青嶂骨，文烂玉霄笺。\n河汉清无敌，沧溟势欲连。\n镜平飞组练，珠抱睡蜿蜒。\n马饮河图出，龟呈洛数全。\n嫁蟾桥度鹊，入鸟镜窥鸾。\n河伯羞夸大，秦鞭浪欲填。\n寿筹逢海屋，仙乐洞庭弦。\n雪艇寒无恙，星槎夜欲编。\n一虚空碍滞，万象讶森骈。\n孕秀生豪杰，高门得世贤。\n忽逢江上老，疑是水中仙。\n湛一心源寂，澜翻舌本悬。\n诗怀倾浩荡，道体见渊泉。\n浊激尘滓散，冥窥混沌穿。\n暮春陪点浴，清夜共熹沿。\n淡薄交情古，光明夜气鲜。\n灵均曾种芷，茂叔为栽莲。\n白发欺明月，愁心散紫烟。\n羊裘霞外钓，渔笛月中舷。\n严濑名高斗，愚溪唾积渊。\n随波岂吾事，浮海竟谁缘。\n机外鸥三点，间中鹭一拳。\n榻篷来鹤梦，歌棹动龙眠。\n世态随阳雁，尘根脱壳蝉。\n濯缨呼孺子，鼓枻斗婵娟。\n海若低偷眼，冯夷醉拍肩。\n谈玄惊鬼胆，话妙破天权。\n夙好罗浮客，呼来不上船。\n菜园宽似海，醉笔大於掾。\n运泰肥三极，歌传满大千。\n傍花眉展秀，见酒口流涎。\n乐水心元癖，寻山意亦便。\n正冠来入社，润笔不须钱。\n治世三生佛，闲官一味禅。\n著书深闭户，共尔磨兜坚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10822,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雯峰山水吟并引","author":"罗伦","text":"造化钟神秀，雯峰好山水。\n人道昆崙来，起止三万里。\n其根盘广莫，枝叶布寰宇。\n恒碣维北门，皇都天帝主。\n在德不在险，古道吾有取。\n是邦固雄壮，奇秀实在此。\n天功巧雕琢，无乃役神鬼。\n万马雪中奔，群鹤自天翥。\n蜿蜒翔蛟龙，蹲踞降虎兕。\n玉堂端笔锋，宝殿开斧扆。\n武侯八阵图，李靖六华垒。\n疏凿神禹功，积聚伏波米。\n众奇杂前陈，眼手惊顾指。\n太守好事者，伊此开别墅。\n野师方云云，道眼自许许。\n病夫一经过，极口叹不已。\n奇宝委道傍，盲者宜弗视。\n良骥非伯乐，盐车竟垂耳。\n太守闻予言，一夜喜不寐。\n予为大守说，风水何足恃。\n聊此娱吾生，百年能有几。\n贫贱我辈安，富贵子孙喜。\n富贵足良图，在此不在彼。\n我昔登东山，周爰观阙里。\n荒哉曲阜城，离离满禾黍。\n巍巍鲁东家，天地与终始。\n后来希圣徒，亦有朱夫子。\n四海几沧桑，两家大华峙。\n先民重积德，德积福乃趾。\n云何晋唐后，邪说爇天起。\n青囊不自课，金函与谁启。\n有术勿自福，况福它人只。\n何当焚其书，一洗青山耻。\n由来积德门，光岳钟英伟。\n君家尚勉旃，螽斯蛰麟趾。\n孔朱有遗训，曾杨休挂齿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10823,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示学者","author":"罗伦","text":"碧天如水浩无穷，万劫消沈昼夜同。\n独步鸿濛谁不死，一丸光动紫薇中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10824,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅窗四好","author":"罗伦","text":"冻合山河骨未摧，重阴先透一阳回。\n东风独与春光首，商鼎调羹俟子来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10825,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题李氏怀恩堂","author":"罗伦","text":"东风何事欲沾巾，犹未全归七尺身。\n一片昊天头上立，此生长照此心真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10826,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题朋江朱望震成趣园","author":"罗伦","text":"忽闻屐齿惊苍苔，可是渊明归去来。\n平生此老用不尽，黄金无数寒香开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10827,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答广德太守周梁石以近体见规兼遗古琴欲以养中和之德者","author":"罗伦","text":"湖西风月吴江旧，广德烟花越锦新。\n不是五弦传太古，梦中谁与出天真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10828,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄胡梅川","author":"罗伦","text":"金精山下漏春光，雪里春回一线阳。\n谢得梅花清到骨，东风长寿万年香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10829,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题五云萧氏三公五爵图","author":"罗伦","text":"汉苑唐宫世已空，莫将兴废语东风。\n人间万事皆尘土，一段繁华又梦中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10830,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋日代修笃四叔作送马生归南海","author":"罗伦","text":"青天拾得中秋月，照破阎浮万劫尘。\n昨夜长风吹不断，清光随著海南人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10831,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧宜冲见陈公甫于白沙胡宪副希仁隆礼下之海天空阔风日和畅招霞外布衣林缉熙何时矩李德孚辈更酬互答律倡吕和绰有雩下风致宜冲袖谒一峰山中因题其首曰海天吟弄并续貂焉以俟于诸君 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"太虚云去天无衣，洞门两断山开扉。\n山人莫袖东风手，指点梅花无是非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10832,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧宜冲见陈公甫于白沙胡宪副希仁隆礼下之海天空阔风日和畅招霞外布衣林缉熙何时矩李德孚辈更酬互答律倡吕和绰有雩下风致宜冲袖谒一峰山中因题其首曰海天吟弄并续貂焉以俟于诸君 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"海天袖得蓬莱回，眼里衡庐安在哉。\n三十六峰吟不尽，朱张还向雪中来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10833,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题新喻袁孝子方泰草亭","author":"罗伦","text":"风花高下草烟青，春满袁家孝子亭。\n阿母瑶池香梦杳，綵衣犹隔翠云屏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10834,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠隐士","author":"罗伦","text":"此翁行坐一壶天，甲子流年大挠先。\n却笑君平生计拙，自家风月不须钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10835,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送施生归新喻","author":"罗伦","text":"南海清风宇宙流，林何分得白沙秋。\n西湖一尺先天雪，辜负寒光六月浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10836,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示万载彭用中陈鑘二首 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"仓黄纸上闲言语，寂寞玄天独此心。\n桐树未秋明月古，山童沈睡草堂深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10837,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示万载彭用中陈鑘二首 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"淡烟疏雨野人家，独立苍茫眼欲花。\n篱落昼长鸡犬静，春光恰好到桑麻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10838,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽同年刘显仁","author":"罗伦","text":"丙戌同年三百五，泥涂甲子是君先。\n黄鹂莫说瀛洲梦，山下春花正可怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10839,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陈壁蔡玹二首 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"闻道东华老秀才，自将双脚涴黄埃。\n知君不是寻常客，解取栖云嶂上来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10840,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]